    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sharon Murray",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101735602786710683799/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocInd2D0V0jp3Esk7lLOi6Rf_2zLcI-XydfSzh-aLyyAb6BeZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "We were previously with another mechanic on the South Shore for over 14 years. At one point, our company vehicle required immediate repairs. Since Pro Rides is located in our area (Vaudreuil-Dorion), we contacted them to service our vehicle. The quality of their service and their mechanics are First-Class! Their pricing is very competitive and they work with their clients to offer cost-effective solutions. Special thanks to Jesse for always being so accommodating with our busy schedule. Since we have experienced Pro Rides, we have entrusted them with both our personal and company vehicles ever since. We highly recommend them without hesitation.\nTheo Sideris - Owner of LES ENTREPRISES SIDERIS",
        "time": 1758924301,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Warhorse Majar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115717808430990229426/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr-pz38geYBD73TqngKKfbVe9BRbDYEoU-DcsyLcW0553yFw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "These guys are like family amazing takes people in right away that are an urge of need. There’s nowhere else I’d rather go. These guys are professional. They’re polite amazing. There’s nobody out there like them. They’ll take you in right away no matter what the cause of the vehicle, there’s professional workers here and they are professional Their courtesy. They are very nice. Best world I’ve ever been to and I would never go anywhere else, but damn thank you guys.",
        "time": 1755550393,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Steve B",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106200802427006942486/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIMFvAVolpUZa_4SjfR4jZrKsH7Duh_924dVtHpkKJZALweA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very good service. Got my tires changed there two years in a row. Highly recommend",
        "time": 1763480942,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chrystal McTurk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118319936123536020015/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3baW5q1W4D8Y7TSC3L5fxAKh3qxsCoR4MnYw803t_ffIRYhaMlA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "It's been since May 26 that I've been trying to get a hold of the owner so that he can fix his mistake but he makes it very difficult to meet.\n\nI called him up on the phone to ask if he would be able to fix a minor dent on my car door (see attached pictures showing before). He responded he would have to see the dent. So I brought my car for him to see and he stated that he could fix it for 250$ with partial paint. I was glad and said I would bring it in the Thursday May 25 (we met on Tuesday). He also told me it would be ready by end of day on Thursday. I brought it Thursday. I had to call them on Friday to know when it would be ready and he told me Saturday. So 2 more days then what he stated.\n\nI arrived Saturday, and the dent was slightly fixed but still present. Paint was put on top of the rust instead of filing it down prior to paint. The inside of the car door has scratches.\nMy dad told him it wasn't a good job. He told my dad he's not a body shop and my Dad asked him why he accepted the job then. He then lied and said that he told me he wasn't a body shop. But he only told me he could do partial paint but said he could fix the dent.\n\nThe owner told me that rustproof could be done in the summer as well.\n\nNow, I noticed there are also scratches where paint was applied, they probably tried to scratch it down.\n\nThe owner cannot keep his word, lies about when a job will be done and lies about his competencies. So for 250$, I still have a partial dent that I was told could be completely fixed, partial paint over rust with scratches now and my inside door that was intact now has scratches...\n\nI wasn't given my receipt for the job and not even a paper following the inspection on my car that I requested.\n\nI highly suggest you go to a place where they value their customers and their time & money. If I could give 0 stars, I would.",
        "time": 1718129973,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Leonora Barcenas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118277161743820714839/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQhQKdjqAWN7wuFJ8_onHt02DXQxu-h8RwVCtWIBEBRUm0OVG9Kg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "This garage is exceptional. From the moment I arrived, I was impressed by the cleanliness and organization of the place. The atmosphere is very professional and well-organized, which immediately gave me confidence. The services offered are clearly displayed, and the facilities are modern, showing that they invest in maintaining high standards\nThe owner and employees were very friendly and attentive at all times. They explained the procedures in detail and made sure I was comfortable while waiting. It was clear they have a lot of experience and knowledge in what they do, which gave me great peace of mind.\nThe work was completed quickly and efficiently. They solved the issue with my vehicle without any problems and with excellent quality. Additionally, the costs were transparent and reasonable, with no surprises at the end. I truly appreciate their professionalism",
        "time": 1744835674,
        "translated": false
      }
